<title>FAROE ISLANDS: SOCCER-FAROE ISLANDS BEAT MALTA 2-1.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FAROE ISLANDS BEAT MALTA 2-1.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Faroe Islands beat Malta 2-1</p>
<p>(halftime 0-1) in their World Cup soccer European group six</p>
<p>qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Malta - Stefan Sultana 8</p>
<p>Faroe Islands - Ossur Hansen 60pen, Tody Jonsson 90.</p>
